SUMMARY:No fast today (because next day is mahadvadashi). Sriman Mahaprabhu leaves Nabadwip in the night to go to Katwa to take sannyas (Makar Sankranti, the day on which Mahaprabhu departs from his home to take the vows of sannyasa, is calculated annually based on the solar calendar).
